<title>UK: Managers buy BTR Dunlop tyre cord maker.</title>
<headline>Managers buy BTR Dunlop tyre cord maker.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A management team at Dunlop Textiles Ltd has bought the company from its parent -- Anglo-Australian conglomerate BTR Plc -- for 7.1 million stg cash, the firms said on Thursday.</p>
<p>With turnover of about 12 million stg, tyre cord maker Dunlop Textiles employs over 70 people at factories in Scotland and northern England.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
